      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chest pain is a common symptom of older children and adolescents. The majority of the conditions causing it are benign and self-limiting. Almost all diagnoses can be made with a thorough history and physical examination. Most important, the patient and parents need to be assured that there is no heart defect and that there is no imminent danger of dying."},
